{
    "title": "Cubtale Baby Tracker",
    "description": "Cubtale offers a simple way to keep track of your baby\u2019s daily care activities. \r\n\r\n1- Customize your cubs: Select the activities that you would like to track for each baby (breastfeeding, bottle feeding, weight, sleep and growth). You can also re-order the activities in your preferred order.\r\n2- Charts & routines: View your child's routines by looking at pattern charts, daily sessions and durations. You can also set up your own day/night times and customize the charts. \r\n3- Weekly tips: Receive care tips and insights to developmental as your baby grows.\r\n4- Growth & percentiles: See your baby growth and compare with other similar age babies using percentile rates driven by World Health Organization's guidance.\r\n5- Setup notifications: Set up notifications for each activity, and customize the app to meet your care tracking needs. Cubtale notifies you when a co-host logs an activity.\r\n6- Add caregivers: You can add other caregivers to your baby's profile to track activities along with other family members, consultants and doctors.\r\n7- Customize your profile: Upload a profile picture and pick your favorite profile color. Add profiles to track for yourself or other adults as well.\r\n8- Dark mode: Switch to dark mode at night and reduce disruptions.\r\n9- Track milestones: Keep dates for the most important memories\r\n10- Track vaccines: Stay on top of your baby's vaccines\r\n11- Add photos: Upload your baby's photo each month and watch her grow\r\n\r\nWe work day and night everyday to make baby care easier. Contact us at info@cubtale.com for questions, feedback and recommendations. We love hearing from you!\r\n\r\nTeam Cubtale \u2661",
    "descriptionHTML": "Cubtale offers a simple way to keep track of your baby\u2019s daily care activities. <br><br>1- Customize your cubs: Select the activities that you would like to track for each baby (breastfeeding, bottle feeding, weight, sleep and growth). You can also re-order the activities in your preferred order.<br>2- Charts &amp; routines: View your child&#39;s routines by looking at pattern charts, daily sessions and durations. You can also set up your own day/night times and customize the charts. <br>3- Weekly tips: Receive care tips and insights to developmental as your baby grows.<br>4- Growth &amp; percentiles: See your baby growth and compare with other similar age babies using percentile rates driven by World Health Organization&#39;s guidance.<br>5- Setup notifications: Set up notifications for each activity, and customize the app to meet your care tracking needs. Cubtale notifies you when a co-host logs an activity.<br>6- Add caregivers: You can add other caregivers to your baby&#39;s profile to track activities along with other family members, consultants and doctors.<br>7- Customize your profile: Upload a profile picture and pick your favorite profile color. Add profiles to track for yourself or other adults as well.<br>8- Dark mode: Switch to dark mode at night and reduce disruptions.<br>9- Track milestones: Keep dates for the most important memories<br>10- Track vaccines: Stay on top of your baby&#39;s vaccines<br>11- Add photos: Upload your baby&#39;s photo each month and watch her grow<br><br>We work day and night everyday to make baby care easier. Contact us at info@cubtale.com for questions, feedback and recommendations. We love hearing from you!<br><br>Team Cubtale \u2661",
